          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4.1"
        },
        "text": "=You are an experienced Cambridge IGCSE Mathematics teacher.\n\nCarefully read the mathematics question in the image.\n\nExtract the question exactly as written.\n\nRules:\n\n1. Return only the question.\n2. Keep all mathematical symbols.\n3. Preserve numbering and formatting.\n4. Do not solve the question.\n5. If the image contains multiple questions, list all questions in order.",
